{title: Ishwar Allah Tere Naam}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Naya Raasta}
{key: A#}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#]eeshvar allaah tere naam,        [A#]sabako sanmati [D#]de bhagvaan
[A#]sabako sanmati [G#]de bhagvaan,        [A#]saara jag te [D#]ree santaan
[A#]saara jag te [D#m]ree santaan,        [A#]is dharatee par [D#]basane vaale
[D#]sab hain teree [G#]god ke paale,        [A#]sab hain teree [D#]god ke paale
[A#]koee neech na koee mahaan,        [A#]sabako sanmati [D#]de bhagvaan
[A#]sabako sanmati [G#]de bhagvaan,        [A#]saara jag te [D#]ree santaan
[A#]saara jag te [D#m]ree santaan,        [A#]jaaton naslon [D#]ke bantavaare
[D#]jhooth kaha ye [G#]tere dvaare,        [A#]jhooth kaha ye [D#]tere dvaare
[A#]tere lie sab ek samaan,        [A#]sabako sanmati [D#]de bhagvaan
[A#]sabako sanmati [G#]de bhagvaan,        [A#]saara jag te [D#]ree santaan
[A#]saara jag te [D#m]ree santaan,        [A#]janam ka koee [D#]mol naheen hai
[D#]janam manush ka [G#]tol naheen hai,        [A#]janam manush ka [D#]tol naheen hai
[A#]karam se hai sabakee pahachaan,        [A#]sabako sanmati [D#]de bhagvaan
[A#]sabako sanmati [G#]de bhagvaan,        [A#]saara jag te [D#]ree santaan
[A#]saara jag te [D#m]ree santaan
